   exp:"บางตำราเรียก \"4T\": thymoma, teratoma, thyroid, terrible lymphoma · middle mediastinum = 3A (adenopathy, aneurysm/vascular, abnormalities of development เช่น bronchogenic cyst) · posterior = neurogenic tumor, aortic aneurysm, paravertebral abscess, extramedullary hematopoiesis (thalassemia)",
